{"v3_6b964e15f7994b1a021e5241":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは\n海邉朱莉です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前募集させていただいた質問に答えていきます！\nたくさん送っていただき本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 好きな数字は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 8かなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 6期生メンバーで一緒に遊びに行くメンバーは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- ちょっと前にうるみんとお寿司食べたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ いつも何時間ぐらい寝てる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 平均7〜8時間くらい。寝ようと思えば一日中寝れます(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 先輩から服貰ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 五百城さんからいただいて、着させてもらってます！ありがとうございます！嬉しい！^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 毎年ドラえもんの映画は映画館まで観に行く？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 観に行きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 好きな作家さんとオススメの作品教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 瀬尾まいこさんの「夜明けのすべて」です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 朝のルーティンで毎日心がけてることある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- うーん、お水飲むとかかなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 地元とに里帰りした時に必ず食べるものは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- お鍋と焼きとり〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 家にお気に入りのぬいぐるみはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 一緒に上京してきたドラえもんがいるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪ 最近、1日で何個アイス食べた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"- 1番多い時で3個！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type